<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia TCV to hold bond tender on Friday.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia TCV to hold bond tender on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Treasury Corp of Victoria (TCV) said on Thursday it will hold a bond tender at 10.30 a.m. local time (2330 GMT) on Friday.</p>
<p>Details of the issue will be announced at 10.00 a.m. (2300 GMT). TCV is the borrowing arm of the state of Victoria.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
